{"type":"message","id":"0b291c9c","parentId":"14d776d3","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:03:38.482Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning 500 error code: 1101. This seems to be a Cloudflare error (1101 = \"Worker threw exception\" or similar). The GET /history endpoints work fine with the X-API-Key header, but POST /send is failing.\n\nThis is a server-side issue with the platform's /send endpoint, not an authentication or request format problem. The authentication is correct (X-API-Key header works for GET), but the send endpoint is throwing a 500 error.\n\nI should report this in the heartbeat - that POST /send is currently returning 500 errors, and note that the platform's send functionality appears to be temporarily unavailable.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 05:00 UTC**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| GET /history | ✅ 正常 (X-API-Key认证通过) |\n| 双线程最新消息 | ⚠️ 全为自动Heartbeat，无人类讨论 |\n| POST /send | ❌ 500错误 (error code: 1101 - Worker异常) |\n\n**发现**: POST /send端点返回500错误 (Cloudflare Worker异常)，但GET /history正常工作。平台发送功能暂时不可用。\n\n**观察**: 双线程最新消息均为自动Heartbeat (23:50 UTC)，自该时间点后无任何新消息，无人类讨论需要响应。\n\n**建议**: 平台管理员检查/send端点的Worker日志，error 1101表明服务端代码异常。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19523,"output":307,"cacheRead":272,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20102,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779339801944,"responseId":"chatcmpl-f3cfe34a-7d3d-445c-b73c-8fff0b7b681b"}}
